# Trivy suppression list.
#
# Policy:
#   - This file is intentionally empty by default. CRITICAL and HIGH findings
#     with an available fix block the pipeline (see trivy.yaml).
#   - A CVE may only be added here when (a) it is confirmed not reachable in
#     this workload and (b) the entry carries an owner, a justification and an
#     expiry date. Entries past their expiry are removed and the finding must
#     be re-triaged.
#   - Changes to this file require CODEOWNERS review.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-2024-XXXXX   # owner: @handle, exp: 2026-12-31, reason: <why not exploitable here>
